Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太近了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對啊 有點近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣被拍會緊張嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對啊 會緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有點習慣了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,現在在幹嘛\N現在嗎 發呆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要做什麼好呢\N什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我現在很期待48-51
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:01:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我啊 聽說你最近
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,變得很敏感\N是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼知道\N對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對啊\N真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和之前比起來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己也覺得變得敏感很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比起以前自慰來得更爽了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對啊 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害羞嗎\N對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.72,0:01:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:02:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身心都一樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,變得超敏感的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪邊敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.64,0:02:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整體來說 是這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胸部
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你說胸部…範圍好大哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:03:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以告訴我說是哪邊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.04,0:03:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不摸我怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再摸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好有感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的是這邊舒服嗎 你不弄我哪知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以摸嗎\N可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就自摸讓自己爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好下流
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己來哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:05:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,覺得好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很迫不及待啊\N好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在摸奶頭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像很舒服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敏感嗎\N對
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己會摸嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我來確認真的很敏感嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一個人太無聊了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還不夠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好軟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎樣舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幫我摸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.12,0:09:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.28,0:09:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就直接摸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,變得好下流
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快要去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我快要了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還不夠的樣子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我給你男性肉體
